  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: How cute ! She is still waiting for us at home after all this time.
  - speaker: 1
    text: "She still hasn\u2019t understood that we love this place and that we want
      to stay there !"
  - speaker: 0
    text: But... How could you prefer to stay in the middle of this carnage rather
      than to go home ?!
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Oh, you know, I don\u2019t think anything is really waiting for me at
      home anymore. Look at me ! Do I seem like I still have a little bit of sanity
      ?!"
